        "conversation_id": "c0efb32d-072b-4f43-a038-d11ed08ffe8f",
        "reply": "Rendang is a slow-cooked beef curry from West Sumatra (Padang cuisine). Beef is simmered for hours in coconut milk with lemongrass, galangal, turmeric, kaffir lime and chilli until the liquid reduces and the meat turns dark and rich. Best found at Padang restaurants (rumah makan Padang) — the classic ordering style is a bench of small dishes brought to your table, you pay for what you eat. (Source: NEX Indonesia knowledge · West Sumatra · verified 2026-08-30T00:00:00.000Z.)",
